# ClaudePane

A Claude Code session behind a swappable session backend (multiplexer, detach
tool, or Daedalus's own session process; edict 0012 leaves the choice open).
A persistent backend keeps the session alive across TUI restarts; the plain-PTY
fallback says so when it can't.

@attached
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Claude · session daedalus-main                        ● working │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ > diagram NeedsYou's internals                                  │
│                                                                 │
│ ● Reading docs/design/tui/shell.oph                             │
│ ● Writing docs/design/tui/needs-kohl.oph                        │
│                                                                 │
│                                                                 │
│                                                                 │
│                                                                 │
│                                                                 │
│ > _                                                             │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
note: border is $accent when focused, $panel when not; the strip shows idle/working.

